gn worker can also take", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 756}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjiioE7", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 446, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8899473, "raw_content": "", "author": "ArthurJ", "created": 1792664934391, "profile_picture": "2n7j40CvvfEB", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "1_Badcop", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "thenationalpulse.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjiioE7.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://thenationalpulse.com/2026/10/21/data-le-pen-extends-presidential-polling-lead-as-france-slides-into-chaos/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Le Pen Extends Presidential Polling Lead as France Slides Into Chaos.", "last_comment_created": 1792714760454, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 446, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "", "large_image": "ZVcvxey7n4eyIwer.png", "title": "DATA: Le Pen Extends Presidential Polling Lead as France Slides Into Chaos."}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVjiioIG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 422, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8899484, "raw_content": "I know it\u2019s early voting and it doesn\u2019t really matter, but I went to the polling station yesterday because it was on the way to a place I was going anyway. I walked in, and the number of Democrats and left-leaning people I saw was pretty overwhelming.\n\nHow do I know they were left-leaning? Well, the various older white women with short boy cuts, the gay-looking dudes, and the younger women showing up. There was a woman next to me, and I glanced over at her ballot and saw she was going full Democrat.\n\nAgain, this isn\u2019t a doom post, but y\u2019all really need to get out there and vote.", "author": "thisguy883", "created": 1792665834933, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "jonnyuno", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I voted in Texas. The place was full of Democrats.", "last_comment_created": 1792718686465, "content": "<p>I know it\u2019s early voting and it doesn\u2019t really matter, but I went to the polling station yesterday because it was on the way to a place I was going anyway. I walked in, and the number of Democrats and left-leaning people I saw was pretty overwhelming.</p>\n<p>How do I know they were left-leaning? Well, the various older white women with short boy cuts, the gay-looking dudes, and the younger women showing up. There was a woman next to me, and I glanced over at her ballot and saw she was going full Democrat.</p>\n<p>Again, this isn\u2019t a doom post, but y\u2019all really need to get out there and vote.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 85, "score_up": 422, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2113322058884977065", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "